1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,361
Your phone might be draining your energy. Try these four habits.

2
00:00:05,611 --> 00:00:08,342
One. Turn off notifications you don't need.

3
00:00:09,392 --> 00:00:12,307
Two. Keep your phone out of reach while you work or eat.

4
00:00:13,257 --> 00:00:17,705
Three. Rest your eyes. Every twenty minutes, look away for twenty seconds.

5
00:00:18,755 --> 00:00:23,004
Four. No screens in bed. Charge your phone outside your bedroom.

6
00:00:24,054 --> 00:00:27,084
What's your screen time today? Tell me in the comments.

7
00:00:28,734 --> 00:00:31,495
Follow me for more health and wellness content.

